uide-ibm-linux-power-little-endian-systems.pdf","html":"lplig/index.html","position":4},{"title":"Database Client Installation Guide for Linux","description":"Describes how to install and configure Oracle Database client on Linux.","category":"Linux Installation Guides","pdf":"lacli/database-client-installation-guide-linux.pdf","html":"lacli/index.html","position":5},{"title":"Database Installation Guide for Linux","description":"Provides configuration information for network and system administrators, and database installation information for database administrators (DBAs) who install and configure Oracle Database and Oracle Grid Infrastructure for a standalone server on Linux.","category":"Linux Installation Guides","pdf":"ladbi/database-installation-guide-linux.pdf","html":"ladbi/index.html","position":6},{"title":"Grid Infrastructure Installation and Upgrade Guide for Linux","description":"Describes how to install and upgrade grid infrastructure for a cluster software, which includes Oracle Clusterware and Oracle Automatic Storage Management (Oracle ASM), on systems running Linux.","category":"Linux Installation Guides","pdf":"cwlin/grid-infrastructure-installation-and-upgrade-guide-linux.pdf","html":"cwlin/index.html","position":7},{"title":"Database Client Installation Guide for Oracle Solaris","description":"Describes how to install and configure Oracle Database Client on Oracle Solaris.","category":"Solaris Installation Guides","pdf":"sscli/database-client-installation-guide-oracle-solaris.pdf","html":"sscli/index.html","position":8},{"title":"Database Installation Guide for Oracle Solaris","description":"Provides configuration information for network and system administrators, and database installation information for database administrators (DBAs) who install and configure Oracle Database, and Oracle Grid Infrastructure for a standalone server on Oracle Solaris.","category":"Solaris Installation Guides","pdf":"ssdbi/database-installation-guide-oracle-solaris.pdf","html":"ssdbi/index.html","position":9},{"title":"Grid Infrastructure Installation and Upgrade Guide for Oracle Solaris","description":"Describes how to install and upgrade Oracle Grid Infrastructure for a cluster software, which includes Oracle Clusterware and Oracle Automatic Storage Management (Oracle ASM), on systems running Oracle Solaris.","category":"Solaris Installation Guides","pdf":"cwsol/grid-infrastructure-installation-and-upgrade-guide-oracle-solaris.pdf","html":"cwsol/index.html","position":10},{"title":"Database Client Installation Guide for IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit)","description":"Describes how to install and configure Oracle Database Client on IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit).","category":"AIX Installation Guides","pdf":"axcli/database-client-installation-guide-ibm-aix-power-systems-64-bit.pdf","html":"axcli/index.html","position":11},{"title":"Database Installation Guide for IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit)","description":"Provides configuration information for network and system administrators, and database installation information for database administrators (DBAs) who install and configure Oracle Database, and Oracle Grid Infrastructure for a standalone server on IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit).","category":"AIX Installation Guides","pdf":"axdbi/database-installation-guide-ibm-aix-power-systems-64-bit.pdf","html":"axdbi/index.html","position":12},{"title":"Grid Infrastructure Installation and Upgrade Guide for IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit)","description":"Describes how to install and upgrade grid infrastructure for a cluster software, which includes Oracle Clusterware and Oracle Automatic Storage Management (Oracle ASM), on systems running IBM AIX on POWER Systems (64-Bit).","category":"AIX Installation Guides","pdf":"cwaix/grid-infrastructure-installation-and-upgrade-guide-ibm-aix-power-systems-64-bit.pdf","html":"cwaix/index.html","position":13},{"title":"Database Client Installation Guide for Microsoft Windows","descr